Make a shelf from a collection and arrange it by hand
Long-press a shelf's tab to open its editor
Tap New shelf
Choose Your own collection
Pick one of your collections, or make one with + New collection
It opens as spines, each book facing out
Tap Close
Long-press a book to arrange the shelf
Swipe the book to move it one place
Swipe the other way to move it back
Add ornament puts one beside the book
Tap the ornament to arrange it instead
Swipe it along, just like a book
Tap the X. The shelf keeps your order
